  "goodToKnow": "Herab means down from above towards the speaker, and it's more formal than herunter or colloquial runter. It's mostly a prefix: herabsetzen (to reduce or belittle), herabsteigen, herabhängen. Figuratively, auf jemanden herabsehen means to look down on someone, and herablassend means condescending: ein herablassender Ton. The opposite direction is hinauf or herauf (up)."
